WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.431 --> 00:00:03.963
- You say, "Ew"?

00:00:03.963 --> 00:00:05.210
Who say, "Ew"?

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:06.116
This is really good.

00:00:06.116 --> 00:00:08.533
(rock music)

00:00:09.574 --> 00:00:12.248
- I've never had dulce de leche before,

00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:14.429
but I did take three years of Spanish

00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:16.942
so I can guess that this
is some sort of combination

00:00:16.942 --> 00:00:18.359
of milk and sugar.

00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:19.404
- Of course I love dulce de leche.

00:00:19.404 --> 00:00:20.987
I'm latino as fuck.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.689
- This is caramel.

00:00:25.798 --> 00:00:27.362
What is it?

00:00:27.362 --> 00:00:28.936
This is dulce de leche?

00:00:28.936 --> 00:00:29.816
This?

00:00:29.816 --> 00:00:32.231
- I'm guessing this is
flan with dulce de leche?

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:33.064
Oh my God.

00:00:33.924 --> 00:00:36.016
- It's almost like sinful peanut butter.

00:00:36.016 --> 00:00:37.782
It has the texture of peanut butter,

00:00:37.782 --> 00:00:40.145
but I feel terrible about
myself when I eat it.

00:00:40.145 --> 00:00:42.769
- I don't like this part,
but this part is great.

00:00:42.769 --> 00:00:45.005
The actual dulce de leche, that's amazing.

00:00:45.005 --> 00:00:46.671
- It doesn't scream in your mouth,

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.584
"Oh my God, I'm sweet!"

00:00:48.584 --> 00:00:52.271
It's mostly like, "Hey, girl,
I'm gonna hug your tastebuds."

00:00:52.271 --> 00:00:53.785
- It's like putting the
two best things together.

00:00:53.785 --> 00:00:56.397
It's like if Biggie and
Tupac made a song together.

00:00:56.397 --> 00:00:59.082
(rock music)

00:00:59.082 --> 00:00:59.999
- Guess it.

00:01:01.622 --> 00:01:03.619
- I don't know what to think about this,

00:01:03.619 --> 00:01:05.786
but I want it in my mouth.

00:01:09.014 --> 00:01:10.757
- Oh my God.

00:01:10.757 --> 00:01:11.924
- Oh. My. God.

00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:14.175
This is the best thing ever.

00:01:14.175 --> 00:01:15.514
I'm not ever being extra.

00:01:15.514 --> 00:01:16.347
- So good.

00:01:18.259 --> 00:01:21.067
It's like flaky, and
again sugary and sweet,

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:22.511
but like not too sweet.

00:01:22.511 --> 00:01:24.268
- I didn't want to try
this other thing because

00:01:24.268 --> 00:01:26.018
I'm really into this.

00:01:28.573 --> 00:01:32.918
- The dulce de leche is
sandwiched between two cookies.

00:01:32.918 --> 00:01:36.235
Then it's like drenched
in chocolate or meringue,

00:01:36.235 --> 00:01:38.388
like what more do you want in your life?

00:01:38.388 --> 00:01:39.913
- These look like little Oreos.

00:01:39.913 --> 00:01:41.702
Oreo plus this dulce de leche stuff,

00:01:41.702 --> 00:01:43.969
like I'll never eat Oreos again.

00:01:43.969 --> 00:01:46.096
- What is inside of it?

00:01:46.096 --> 00:01:47.013
So caramel.

00:01:48.236 --> 00:01:49.975
Okay, just kidding, Argentinians.

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:52.280
- This one's a little more chewy,

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:55.047
kind of like eating a Snickers, I imagine.

00:01:55.047 --> 00:01:56.509
I'm allergic to nuts,
so I don't really know

00:01:56.509 --> 00:01:57.342
what that's like.

00:01:57.342 --> 00:02:00.735
- It's honestly like eating
an amazing chocolaty,

00:02:00.735 --> 00:02:02.280
dulce de leche cloud.

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:04.304
- It's like an amped up Girl Scout cookie.

00:02:04.304 --> 00:02:05.501
- Okay, this is love.

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:06.723
Who need relationships?

00:02:06.723 --> 00:02:08.293
- I've had kind of like
the Mexican version

00:02:08.293 --> 00:02:12.239
of dulce de leche, but I've
never had it combined with

00:02:12.239 --> 00:02:14.755
this Argentinian spin.

00:02:14.755 --> 00:02:17.796
- Dulce de leche on
everything is a genius idea.

00:02:17.796 --> 00:02:19.189
I can't believe they had this in Argentina

00:02:19.189 --> 00:02:21.008
and I never tasted it.

00:02:21.008 --> 00:02:23.425
(rock music)

